{"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "b6c11972-2315-44b2-b0ca-d74cf52211c0", "machine": "m4-mini", "project": "brains", "project_dir": "/Users/davidcruwys/dev/ad/brains", "session_type_registry": "KNOWLEDGE", "session_type_analysed": "knowledge.survey_and_implement", "file_size_bytes": 21272, "event_count": 64, "disposition": "active", "interest_level": "medium-high", "notes": "Bulk taxonomy survey of all 36 brains (36 Read calls in ~90s burst) followed by architectural recommendation (subfolders vs frontmatter categories) and immediate Task agent dispatch to implement. Claude produced 8-category taxonomy inline in chat; David pasted it back as agent spec \u2014 inline-knowledge anti-pattern. File count discrepancy investigated (590 curated vs 1500 total files) via 6 Bash probes. 13h gap then single 'commit this' close. No /rename, no handover. Proposed new subtype: knowledge.survey_and_implement (survey triggers implementation in same session). KNOWLEDGE label retained as primary; BUILD component present in second half.", "analysed_at": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z"}
{"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "9476dfb9-0a89-42f1-8469-3970268086cf", "machine": "m4-mini", "project": "brains", "project_dir": "/Users/davidcruwys/dev/ad/brains", "session_type_registry": "KNOWLEDGE", "session_type_analysed": "knowledge.personal_advisory", "file_size_bytes": 6588, "event_count": 21, "disposition": "active", "interest_level": "medium", "notes": "Personal family advisory session misclassified as KNOWLEDGE. David asks about Philippines monitor research for Jan and Mary. Brain search phase (Grep\u00d76, Glob\u00d72, Bash\u00d72, Read\u00d73) found no prior research \u2014 knowledge gap, not knowledge retrieval. Session pivots: David pastes live Lazada URL, Claude invokes Playwright to browse product page (mcp__playwright__browser_navigate) for scam verification. Follow-up prompts on pivot/VESA rotation. No brain files written \u2014 research is session-ephemeral. Three classifier learning signals: (1) Playwright = external_research flag; (2) personal names + consumer topic in first prompt \u2192 personal_advisory; (3) empty search result = knowledge gap, not KNOWLEDGE session. Recommended brain file: brains/davidcruwys/personal/philippines-monitor-research.md (does not exist).", "analysed_at": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z"}
