e edits driven by visual feedback"}, {"name": "Design Exploration \u2014 AWB Landing Variants", "time_start": "2026-03-14T00:53:00Z", "time_end": "2026-03-14T02:22:00Z", "type": "DESIGN_EXPLORATION", "summary": "Resumed via compaction. Screenshotted 17 AWB mock landing pages (V1\u2013V17). Updated AWB workflow step indicator to V10 Pipeline style. Agent sub-calls produced design preference write-up and AppyStack recipe formalisation (5 archetypes: Split, Tiles, Minimal, Compact, Hero)"}], "notable_events": [{"line": 316, "type": "compaction_resume", "description": "Very long user_prompt containing compaction summary (~700 lines). Detectable by prefix 'This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context.'"}, {"line": 420, "type": "accidental_prompt", "description": "Voice-to-text artefact: 'Unknown skill: near-compassion'"}, {"line": 36, "type": "accidental_prompt", "description": "Incomplete voice input: 'why? i'"}, {"lines": [403, 419], "type": "agent_sub_calls", "description": "Two Agent tool invocations spawning sub-agents. Companion agent-*.jsonl files expected with isSidechain: true"}], "notes": "High-interest session for AngelEye pattern library. Demonstrates: (1) multi-phase sessions that require multi-label classification, (2) Playwright MCP volume as a UI_REVIEW signal, (3) detectable compaction_resume events, (4) voice-to-text noise patterns, (5) long autonomous blocks (6.5h gap with no user prompts during Playwright audit). BUILD label from registry is accurate but incomplete.", "analysed_at": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z"}
{"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "e73d7fc7-bd73-476c-8454-2fb5fd1ff7a4", "machine": "m4-mini", "project": "ad", "project_dir": "/Users/davidcruwys/dev/ad", "session_type_registry": "BUILD", "session_type_analysed": "research.external_intake", "file_size_bytes": 10385, "event_count": 2, "disposition": "active", "interest_level": "medium", "notes": "27-minute session at ad monorepo root. 2 user_prompt events only \u2014 zero tool calls, zero assistant_response captured. Prompt 1: terminal history of failed git clone attempts against coleam00/dynamous-engine (SSH key missing, bad HTTPS credentials) + full Dynamous Engine README paste + 'Why can't I access it?'. Prompt 2 (22-min gap): naming question for dynamous-community/workshops clone. Session is research intake of Cole Medin Second Brain architecture \u2014 likely inspirational input for AngelEye design. BUILD mis-classification: no construction activity, no tools, 10KB is paste volume not work volume. New subtype proposed: research.external_intake \u2014 large external README paste + interpretive questions, no tool calls. ad-root sessions should be weighted away from BUILD unless Edit/Write/Bash evidence present.", "analysed_at": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z"}
